        "Title": "The Bangkokian Schmuckle",
        "Location": "LOCATION_BANGKOK",
        "PublicId": "108959065303",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Bangkok/_scene_tiger.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository a86b312d-1d84-413d-ac6d-b3ea5256c66d).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning, 47. You&apos;re headed back to Bangkok, Thailand for a rather intriguing case.\r\rYour targets, Rama Malee and &apos;Prasert&apos; are both infamous in Manitoba, Canada for several instances of hog forgery. While dubious on it&apos;s legality, our client believes if these two manage to sneak away, they will do far worse...\r\rAs well, our client demands you kill their, quote, &quot;Stupid bitch mom.&quot;\r\rOne of our weirder contracts, I&apos;ll say. But paper is paper, and to the ceiling it shall go. Good luck, 47.",
